  "scope": "Actual SM record, checkpoint and client-acknowledgement ownership helper with retained per-turn facts",
  "behavior": [
    "A receiving SM turn owner exists before its child is polled; the child binds the actual ordered FIFO cut, including source-less slots, before persistence",
    "Borrowed preparation binds the complete snapshot, policy and acknowledged projection through the service/database conversion",
    "Existing SQL transactions retain COMMIT entry and successful receipt, or the explicit updated-false rollback entry and successful receipt",
    "Record appends before checkpoint and restores only typed supersession; returned rotations must match the independently retained receipt before local application",
    "ACK uses the existing h arithmetic, preserves separate persisted/nonpersisted paths, and retains FIFO/h application before a later fallible capacity step",
    "Actual native lease composition delegates recording to the real SM helper and checks that persisted SM invokes no native fence or ACK"
  ],
